      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pillars of Alra [zone=812]\n**Who:**\n- Selulian of Melretia [npc=38841]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Arcanists of Alra +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Living Will of Alra -?\n**Quest Items:**\n- Tome of Natural Knowledge [item=100951]\n- Words of Melretia [item=100945]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Pillars #1: The First Pilgrimage [quest=5481]\n- Pillars #2b: The Word of Anriella [quest=5483]\n- Pillars #2c: The Word of Fal`Kaa [quest=5484]\n- Pillars #2d: The Word of Erion [quest=5485]\n- Pillars #3: Crisis of Faith [quest=5486]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 29 23:29:27 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Selulian of Melretia in the Pillars of Alra, located outside the northeastern pillar (360, -620, 450)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"The First Pilgrimage\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Selulian of Melretia'\nSelulian of Melretia says, in Alaran, 'Welcome disciple \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, come to bask in the purity of Alra's true worshipers? Perhaps you are [interested in learning more] about our orde ?''\nYou say, 'I'm interested in learning more'\nSelulian of Melretia smiles, 'Your faith is strong. Rather than bore you with lecture, I shall see to it your lessons involve meaningful action!' It searches its robes for a tattered scroll and holds it out in pront of you, 'As I said before, the ancient stone you recovered details much of our oldest recorded history. What it did not contain was the story yf our exodus and arrival upon this planet. I shall ask that you [take this scroll] to the wayward people of Anriella's order.'\nYou say, 'I'll take this scroll'\nSelulian of Melretia says, in Alaran, 'Very good, spreading the good word of our pur ty may not be an easy task, so I suggest you dy not go alone. After you have broug t clarity to the hearts and minds of these wayward souls, return to me with one of their heretical texts and I shall tell you more of the uncorrupted history of ml people.'\n_You receive a \"Words of Melretia\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Word of Melretia'.\nSelulian has asked you to spread the good word of Melretia. Travel to the Pillar of Nature and seek out the lower caste of workers. Individuals in the basement, foyer, and meditative halls may listen to what you have to say.\n\n---\n\nSpread the word of the arcane to some of the lower caste 0/15 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Head to the southwest pillar and right-click the Words on NPCs in the lower floors. Some of them will aggro on you, so be ready for a fight and sometimes several adds._\n_A positive response (non-aggro):_\nan amalgamation of earth looks at you curiously and nods. They appear receptive to your message.\n_A negative response (instant aggro and social aggro with any mobs around it):_\na natureward initiate says, in Alaran, 'Your heresy has no place here. Prepare to feed the earth!'\nTravel to the upper library in the Pillar of Nature 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Now that you have 'converted' some of the corrupted, travel to the upper library and find a tome detailing Anriella's apocryphal version of Alra's wishes.\nObtain a Tome of Natural Knowledge 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ You may need to 'convince' the librarians to part with their tome via force.\n_This is a random drop in the library._\nReturn the Tome of Natural Knowledge to Selulian 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Now that you have obtained the tome of heretical lies, return it to Selulian so that it can share more of its people's true history with you.\nSelulian of Melretia nods and pulls out a small piece of parchment and speaks, 'Of the Exodus, V of XI... The sects you see now are not the ones of ancient times mind you. The lines of division in those ancient days were physical and less spiritual. My elders were however, the chosen few...'\nYour faction standing with Arcanists of Alra got better.\nYour faction standing with Living Will of Alra got worse.\n(Optional) Impress Selulian with your hasty execution 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n( _Optional: Complete within 30 minutes.)_\n_Rewards:_\n300 platinum\nElatarki's Diary - Four Cornered\n- Eltarki's Diary - Four Cornered [item=100418]\n- Fragment of Legendary Alaran History [item=100964]",
