      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pillars of Alra [zone=812]\n**Who:**\n- Il`Rator of Anriella [npc=38840]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Living Will of Alra +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Arcanists of Alra -?\n**Quest Items:**\n- Disrupted Mana [item=100963]\n- Unyielding Essence of Life [item=100961]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Arcane Guardian Solandrielagral [npc=39745]\n- an arcane interceptor [npc=39746]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Pillars #1: The First Pilgrimage [quest=5481]\n- Pillars #2a: The Word of Melretia [quest=5482]\n- Pillars #2c: The Word of Fal`Kaa [quest=5484]\n- Pillars #2d: The Word of Erion [quest=5485]\n- Pillars #3: Crisis of Faith [quest=5486]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 29 23:29:31 2011\nModified: Sat Dec 9 19:35:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Il`Rator of Anriella in the Pillars of Alra, located outside the southwestern pillar (-345, 610, 435)._.\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"The First Pilgrimage\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Il`Rator of Anriella'\nIl`Rator of Anriella speaks past you, but gives you a friendly nod to acknowledge your presence, 'Friends, allies, the true and loving faithful return! Who among you comes forth with a [question]? The cold and lifeless aura of the heretics can be troubling! I bid you all to seek the loving LIFE that Alra offers!'\nYou say, 'A question?'\nIl`Rator of Anriella says, in Alaran, 'Blessed are we, the faithful, in our journey to spread the life and the word of the great one! I look to you [willing disciples] to bring new life into our world today! Who among you will heed the calling? I promise you answers in your journey!''\nYou say, 'Willing disciples?'\nIl`Rator of Anriella points towards you with an ecstatic smile, 'A familiar face returning to...' It stops, remembering who you are. It beckons you closer and speaks softly, 'You there, yes \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Do not think I have forgotten the lessons you have come to learn from our order. I have a small matter that needs attending to... Complete this [errand] and I shall tell you more of my people's origin!'\nYou say, 'What errand?'\nIl`Rator of Anriella says, in Alaran, 'A simple task, one I have the utmost faith in your ability to complete. In the cold-lifeless depths of Melretia's Pillar is the source of alis sinister power. The corrupted ones feed on the lifelessness of their surroundings. I ask only that you bring life into those cold halls, whatever bloodshed this may entail will be forgiven by Alra, you have my word!''\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Word of Anriella'.\nIl`Rator wishes for you to spread life to the cold halls in the Pillar of the Arcane. Travel to the lower levels and stand in the pool of Arcane Mana. Your spirit will be enough to disrupt its lifeless aura.\n_NOTE: While doing this task, you will have a spell on you called \"Verdaphobia\", which makes you kill-on-sight to mobs in the the Pillar of the Arcane._\n\n---\n\nBring life to the Pool of Arcane Mana 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\nDeal with the arcane interceptors 0/10 (Pillers of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Several interceptors have arrived to remove you from the mana pool, stop them as they arrive!\n_Stand in the mana pool at the bottom of the Arcane Pillar to spawn an arcane interceptor. Once you've killed 10 spawns, these steps update._\n\n---\n\nSeek the remains of the latest fallen Natureward 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ In the lower purification halls, there is the body of a natureward veteran. It was just recently captured and killed and is pending extraction. Find their body and find out why it attempts to enter the Pillar of Nature...\n_In the third floor of the Pillar of the Arcane, you'll find several corpses of Nature Alarans. Right-click one:_\nYou will not have much luck inspecting the fallen with the torturers guarding the room... Take care of them first!\n_Clear the area of mobs and then right-click a corpse. Upon doing so, you'll receive \"Unyielding Essence of Life\"._\n\n---\n\nSabotage the Arcane Infuser 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ It appears the fallen natureward was attempting to disrupt the ability of the arcanists to purify their mana. Finish what Il`Rator's ally has set out to do!\n_Place the \"Unyielding Essence of Life\" in the Arcane Infuser located on the same floor (400, -840, 670) and hit combine. This spawns a named: Arcane Guardian Solandrielagral, who goes aggro._\nArcane Guardian Solandrielagral glares at you contemptibly, 'Let us see if your god deems you worthy of an afterlife!'\n\n---\n\nDefend yourself against the Arcane Guardian 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Disrupting the infuser will be impossible with the elder guard attacking you. Dispatch them before trying again!\n(Optional) Withstand the torture of the Arcane Guardian 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Though the proliferation of life will inevitably entail bloodshed from time to time, Il`Rator is curious if you could sustain the life of the Arcane Guardian long enough for it to see the error of its ways. If it has not learned before it has unleashed its devastating attack three times, then it likely never will.\n_Arcane Guardian Solandrielagral hits for a max ~14,000; AE rampages; and feign-deaths your party. If you want the optional portion of this update, you need to let his AE hit you three times (it's possible this could take some time)._\n_Once he's dead, sabotage the infuser (place the essence inside and hit combine to create \"Disrupted Mana\")._\nAs the natural essence is placed in the arcane infuser there is an ominous silence... A moment passes before the room begins to shake violently! You get the feeling you shouldn't stick around this place much longer.\n_The room shakes and several mobs attack. You don't need to kill them._\n\n---\n\nReport your success to Il`Rator 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\nYou say, 'Hail, Il`Rator of Anriella'\nIl`Rator of Anriella begins to recite what you can only imagine is a written work somewhere in its pillar, 'The Origin, Our Land, III of IX... What is knowable about our history is that we were set-upon by the scaled ones. The wurms of land and air sought dominance over all the lands, so my people took refuge. Our great and loving sustainer rose to prominence in this age. Al gave alis life so that we may grow and live upon this land...\nYour faction standing with Living Will of Alra got better.\nYour faction standing with Arcanists of Alra got worse.\nThe sound of rushing wind seems to echo from atop Alra's shrine.\n_Rewards:_\n375 platinum\nElatarki's Diary - Four Cornered\n- Eltarki's Diary - Four Cornered [item=100418]\n- Fragment of Legendary Alaran History [item=100964]",
