      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pillars of Alra [zone=812]\n**Who:**\n- Wrakt of Fal`Kaa [npc=38838]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Shades of Alra +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n- Purity of Alra -?\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blank Tome of Light [item=100958]\n- Sharp Ayrlak Tooth [item=100956]\n- Spiny Vyrlak Fin [item=100955]\n- Thick Ut`Len Ink [item=100952]\n- Tome of Subversive Truth [item=100959]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a vyrlak fry [npc=38984]\n- an ut`len flaremind [npc=39062]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Pillars #1: The First Pilgrimage [quest=5481]\n- Pillars #2a: The Word of Melretia [quest=5482]\n- Pillars #2b: The Word of Anriella [quest=5483]\n- Pillars #2d: The Word of Erion [quest=5485]\n- Pillars #3: Crisis of Faith [quest=5486]\n- The Growing Threat [quest=5493]\n- The Truth [quest=5492]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 29 23:29:35 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Wrakt of Fal`Kaa in the Pillars of Alra, located just inside the southeastern pillar (-630, -355, 355)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"The First Pilgrimage\"\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Wrakt of Fal`Kaa'\nWrakt of Fal`Kaa nods ind whispers, 'I am quite happy to see you return, disciple \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. With the recent [state of affairs] I am never sure when good news will emerge from the shadows of our world.'\nYou say, 'State of affairs?'\nWrakt of Fal`Kaa motions toward the open door, 'The state of chaos, the state of discord... Our people seek unity, we wish yo cast off the ruinous bonds of division and be a whole nation again. It is unfortunate that the one who was meant to [unify] us would be the focal point of such bitter contempt.'\nYou say, 'Who was meant to unify you?'\nWrakt of Fal`Kaa says, in Alaran, 'As I have said before, Alra's role in our history may be of significantly less importance than my people believe. I offer you the chance to know what few of my people ever shall, if you are [willing to reveal the truth].'\nYou say, 'I'm willing to reveal the truth...'\nWrakt of Fal`Kaa smiles and nods its head, 'Very well, I ask that you work to spread the truth to the misled. They will not listen to reason, so our methods will need to be subtle. The materials you will need are as such...' The evangelist begins detailing its plan.\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Word of Fal`Kaa'.\nWrakt would like for you to collect enough materials to scribe a tome. It feels like a non-direct approach in sharing the message of the shadows will bring about the best results.\n\\- Ut`Len Ink is unmatched in both beauty and function. Collect enough to scribe a full tome.\n\\- Though delicate, the fangs of the Ayrlak are capable of producing breathtakingly beautiful calligraphy. Collect several.\n\\- You will need a vessel to transport the Ut`Len ink. The fins of a Vyrlak should do nicely.\n_NOTE: While in this task, you will have an effect called \"Agents of the Black\" on you, making you kill-on-sight to mobs in the Pillar of Light._\n\n---\n\nCollect several vials worth of Ut`Len ink 0/4 (Pillars of Alra)\nFind some delicate scribing utensils, Ayrlak Teeth should do 0/2 (Pillars of Alra)\nFind some scribing pallets, Vyrlak Fins perhaps 0/3 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Hunt the above mobs in the lake below the pillars, and loot their drops._\nCollect a blank tome from the Pillar of Light's lower library 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Unfinished tomes are stored in the lower library of the Pillar of Light. Much of the students' daily meditation is spent re-scribing the teachings of Erion. Wrakt feels a non-violent approach would be best, but Wrakt isn't the one obtaining the blank tomes, now is it?\n_\"Blank Tome of Light\" is a random drop from mobs in the library._\nScribe the words of truth into the tome of light 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ With all of the needed materials collected, return to the Pillar of the Black and scribe the teachings of shade into the blank tome of light. Using the Infuser of Shade located on the lower purification halls should prove faster than trying to write it by hand.\n_Head to the Pillar of the Black's third floor (-730, -515, 500) and, inside the Infuser of Shade, combine the above 10 items to create \"Tome of Subversive Truth\"._\nA quiet whisper echoes from all corners of the Pillar, it is the voice of Wrakt, 'Your dedication is admirable and your work is impressive. You must now return these words of truth to the halls from which you took the blank tome... I would prefer this done without further bloodshed.'\nNOTE: The task locks here.\nReturn the tome to the Pillar of Light's lower library 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Now that you've snuck truth under the cover of a book of lies, return the tome to the Pillar of Light's library. Place it on one of the outer shelves.\n_Head back to the Pillar of Light's third floor library and roam around until you get an update._\nWrakt of Fal`Kaa whispers, 'Good work, now return to me and we shall discuss a bit more of my people's true history...'\nYou quickly place the tome on the shelf.\nReport your success to Wrakt 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Return to Wrakt and let it know that you have completed all it has asked of you.\n(Optional) Avoid being noticed while in the Pillar of Light 0/9 (Pillar of Alra)\n_Task Window Says:_ Wrakt is displeased in the manner you obtained the blank tome, perhaps you could travel through the Pillar of Light in a less violent fashion? It's unbecoming of the agents of shadow to brazenly cast light and bring death to the unworthy...\nCompleting this optional step successfully gets you a Fragment of Legendary Alaran History.\nYou say, 'Hail, Wrakt of Fal`Kaa'\nWrakt is quite impressed with your discretion in returning the tome. It smiles and hands you a small fragment.\nWrakt of Fal`Kaa speaks quietly, as if to keep others from overhearing, 'The Unity of Shadow V of XI... The universe, the endless expanse and infinite void. We are but a single plane of a multitude, mere puppets to the whims of fate and history. We sway at the will of the elements, and we ourselves as living creatures sway the elements within our power...'\nYour faction standing with Shades of Alra got better.\nYour faction standing with Purity of Alra got worse.\n_Rewards:_\n300 platinum\nElatarki's Diary - Four Cornered\n- Eltarki's Diary - Four Cornered [item=100418]\n- Fragment of Legendary Alaran History [item=100964]",
