      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pillars of Alra [zone=812]\n**Who:**\n- Assistant Shadowward Mysth [npc=38835]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Shadowward Dre`Ryk [npc=39445]\n- Shadowward Votrak [npc=39108]\n- a shadowward captain [npc=38944]\n- a shadowward guardian [npc=38945]\n- a shadowward veteran [npc=38949]\n- an essence shadowward [npc=39041]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 29 23:39:33 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo kill task begins with Assistant Shadowward Mysth in the Pillars of Alra, located at -750, -440, 293 (inside the southeastern pillar, at the bottom of the stairs that lead down from the entry room)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Shadowward Mysth'\nAssistant Shadowward Mysth says, in Alaran, 'Hmph!' It turns away from you in apparent disinterest, 'I've no interest in holding a conversation with a piece of [vermin] - which is what I assume you are. Invaders would know better than to try to address an elite Shadowward, such as myself. Now get out before I alert the guards!'\nYou say, 'What vermin?'\nAssistant Shadowward Mysth says, in Alaran, 'Goodness me! Are you still talking? I said I have no business with you. What could I possibly want from a foul Outsider like-' it stops mid-speech, as something seems to occurs to it. You hear it mutter, 'An outsider.. that's [it]!'\nYou say, 'It?'\nAssistant Shadowward Mysth says, in Alaran, 'Alright,' it heaves a heavy sigh, 'I might be willing to help you with.. oh, whatever it was you wanted,' it waves a hand dismissively, 'but first you must help me. You see, I'm wasted here. I deserve to be a much higher rank than 'Assistant',' it spits the word venomously, 'but unfortunately there are no vacancies... yet.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rising Through the Ranks'.\nMysth has lofty ambitions and even loftier opinions of itself. It has asked, or rather dermanded, that you kill several of the Shadowward captains, so that he may aspire to a more illustrious rank.\n\n---\n\nKill 2 shadowward captains or essence shadowwards 0/2 (Pillars of Alra)\nKill 1 Shadowward Votrak or Shadowward Dre`Ryk 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\nKill 1 shadowward guardian or shadowward veteran 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\n_These mobs are found inside the southeastern pillar (in the entrance level and basement). If none are up, you'll have to kill mobs in the area and wait for respawns._\nSpeak with Assistant Shadowward Mysth 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Shadowward Mysth'\nAssistant Shadowward Mysth says, 'Hmm, oh, did you still want something? I'm terribly sorry, I have new duties to tend to. Perhaps another time.'\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
