      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Pillars of Alra [zone=812]\n**Who:**\n- Natureward Kolthei [npc=38842]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Alaran Language:** | 81\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an animate guardian [npc=38989]\n- an arcane guardian [npc=38997]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 29 23:39:41 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo kill task begins with Natureward Kolthei in the Pillars of Alra, located at -930, 535, 5 (near the zone-in, by the base of the ramp up to the pillars)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Natureward Kolthei'\nNatureward Kolthei stares at you [blankly].\nYou say, 'Why are you staring at me blankly?'\nNatureward Kolthei swats a nearby buzzing insect with it's tongue. '[Ribbit]?', it asks, looking at you hopefully.\nYou say, 'Ribbit?'\nNatureward Kolthei says, in Alaran, 'Froaaak!' It pauses looking at you expectantly and then finally seems to give up. Dropping all pretense of its amphibious demeanor and spitting out the bug, it says suavely, 'Alright, it seems you got me, friend, I'm not really a toad. This is just a [disguise].'\nYou say, 'Why the disguise?'\nNatureward Kolthei says, in Alaran, 'Not so loud!' It pauses, listening for a moment, then continues in a more convivial tone, 'There's an acolyte nearby, from the pillar of the Arcane, who I'd rather not meet just now. Let's just say we have.. a [minor] disagreement.'\nYou say, 'A minor disagreement?'\nNatureward Kolthei says, in Alaran, 'Well, I may have killed one or two of their silly little wyvern statues.' It gives you a conspiratorial wink. 'Actually, it was part of a bet, and really, I still need to take out a few more. I don't suppose you'd mind [helping] me out, while I keep this fool distracted?'\nYou say, 'I don't mind helping'\nNatureward Kolthei gives you a deranged, toothless grin, probably meant as an encouraging smile, and sends you on your way.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Sitting Drakes'.\nKolthei has asked you to take care of a few animate guardians and arcane guardians, while it keeps the Arcward Acolyte distracted.\n\n---\n\nKill 7 animate or arcane guardians 0/7 (Pillars of Alra)\n_These mobs are found outside the northeastern pillar._\nSpeak with Natureward Kolthei 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\nYou say, 'Hail, Natureward Kolthei'\nKolthei thanks you heartily for your help!\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience",
